<!doctype html><html lang="ko"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>알고리즘 기록 · 공개 체험</title><style>body{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 16px;background:#f7f7f8;color:#18181b;font:16px/1.7 system-ui}button,a,input,select{font:inherit}button,a.button{padding:8px 14px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:10px;background:white;color:#183858;cursor:pointer}textarea,pre{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}iframe{width:100%;height:1150px;border:1px solid #ddd;border-radius:16px;background:white}.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:16px 0}.card{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #ddd;margin:16px 0}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,300px),1fr));gap:16px}</style></head><body><a href="index.html">← 포트폴리오</a><h1>알고리즘 기록 · 공개 체험</h1><p>예제 코드로 실행·배속·변수 시각화·출력 비교를 체험합니다. 강의노트와 개인 기록은 포함하지 않습니다. 입력은 이 페이지 메모리에만 유지되며 원격 저장하지 않습니다.</p><div class="row"><button id="demo-array">배열 순회</button><button id="demo-bfs">BFS 큐·그래프</button><button id="demo-stack">스택 괄호 검사</button><label>입력 TXT <input id="demo-input" type="file" accept=".txt"></label></div><section class="card"><label>예상 출력<textarea id="expected" rows="2">6</textarea></label><p id="demo-verdict" role="status">아래에서 실행하면 출력과 첫 차이를 확인합니다.</p><button id="demo-reflect">현재 코드·입력 회고 초안 내려받기</button></section><iframe id="demo-frame" title="공개 Python 실행 시각화" src="learning-lab/index.html?embedded=1&amp;token=public-learning-demo&amp;work=public-demo&amp;ephemeral=1"></iframe><p>첫 실행은 Python 실행기를 내려받아 시간이 걸릴 수 있습니다. 실행 성공은 SWEA 공식 정답 판정과 다릅니다.</p><p><a href="study/index.html#/algo">개인 알고리즘 기록 열기 (잠금)</a> · <a href="evaluation.html">RAG 평가 보기</a></p><script src="learning-lab/learning-core.js"></script><script>
(()=>{const frame=document.querySelector('iframe'),token='public-learning-demo',examples={array:{code:'arr = list(map(int, input().split()))\ntotal = 0\nfor x in arr:\n    total += x\nprint(total)',input:'1 2 3',expected:'6'},bfs:{code:'from collections import deque\ngraph = {0: [1, 2], 1: [3], 2: [3], 3: []}\nqueue = deque([0])\nvisited = {0}\norder = []\nwhile queue:\n    u = queue.popleft()\n    order.append(u)\n    for v in graph[u]:\n        if v not in visited:\n            visited.add(v)\n            queue.append(v)\nprint(order)',input:'',expected:'[0, 1, 2, 3]'},stack:{code:'text = input().strip()\nstack = []\nvalid = True\nfor ch in text:\n    if ch == "(":\n        stack.append(ch)\n    elif ch == ")":\n        if stack:\n            stack.pop()\n        else:\n            valid = False\nprint(valid and not stack)',input:'(()())',expected:'True'}};let state={...examples.array};function send(type){frame.contentWindow.postMessage({type,token,code:state.code,input:state.input,problem:{number:0,title:'공개 체험',level:'예제'}},location.origin)}window.addEventListener('message',e=>{if(e.source!==frame.contentWindow||e.origin!==location.origin||e.data?.token!==token)return;const m=e.data;if(m.type==='algo-work:ready')send('algo-work:load');if(m.type==='algo-work:height')frame.style.height=Math.max(600,Math.min(2600,m.height))+'px';if(m.type==='algo-work:state'){state={...state,...m};if(!m.ran)return;const d=LEARNING_CORE.firstDifference(m.output,document.querySelector('#expected').value);document.querySelector('#demo-verdict').textContent=m.error?'실행 오류: '+m.error:d?'첫 차이: '+d.line+'줄 '+d.column+'번째 문자 · 실제 '+JSON.stringify(d.actualChar)+' / 예상 '+JSON.stringify(d.expectedChar):'예상 출력과 일치합니다.'}});for(const name of Object.keys(examples))document.querySelector('#demo-'+name).onclick=()=>{state={...examples[name]};document.querySelector('#expected').value=state.expected;send('algo-work:replace')};document.querySelector('#demo-input').onchange=async e=>{try{const f=e.target.files[0];if(!f||f.size>100000)throw Error('100KB 이하 TXT를 선택하세요.');const text=(await f.text()).replace(/^\uFEFF/,'');if(text.includes('\0'))throw Error('텍스트 파일을 선택하세요.');state.input=text;send('algo-work:replace')}catch(err){document.querySelector('#demo-verdict').textContent=err.message}};document.querySelector('#demo-reflect').onclick=()=>{const text=LEARNING_CORE.reflection({title:'공개 체험'},state,''),u=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([text],{type:'text/markdown;charset=utf-8'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=u;a.download='learning-reflection.md';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(u),1000)}})();
</script></body></html>
